[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23955.19, "timestamp": "06:39:15", "text": "我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23959.51, "timestamp": "06:39:19", "text": "我的發音沒有錯。晚安.  [音樂] [音樂] 你好。這些都是中文。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23967.27, "timestamp": "06:39:27", "text": "你可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23974.708, "timestamp": "06:39:34", "text": "呃，我只會說幾個字。  [音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23982.35, "timestamp": "06:39:42", "text": "然後她我我學會了呃，下午好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23985.35, "timestamp": "06:39:45", "text": "我忘了那是什麼了。下午好嗎？稍等片刻。  午安"}]